  "description": "FFmpeg-based audio codecs for Cyaim.RTSPClient (AAC, Opus, AMR, Speex, Vorbis, MP3). Proper sample-format negotiation via libswresample; RTSP raw AAC via AudioDecoderConfig.ExtraData. Requires FFmpeg 7.x shared libraries at runtime.",
